{
  "body": "Fixes #2025.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Lazy-load `command-stream`/`use-m` in `src/isolation-runner.lib.mjs` so importing pure helper exports no longer performs a network fetch.\n- Add a regression test that stubs `globalThis.fetch`, imports the isolation runner, and asserts the import made zero fetch calls.\n- Rename stale CI step labels from `Use Node.js 20.x` to `Use Node.js 24.x` where the workflow already used Node 24.\n- Update `azure/setup-helm` from `v4` to `v5`; upstream `v5` uses `node24`, removing the fresh PR warning about Node 20 action runtimes being forced onto Node 24.\n- Preserve the failed-run logs, metadata, local check logs, and CI/CD template snapshots under `docs/case-studies/issue-2025/`.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nRun `29020837748` failed in `test-suites` at `[97/309] tests/test-isolation-runner.mjs` with `TypeError: fetch failed` and Cloudflare `ETIMEDOUT`/IPv6 `ENETUNREACH` errors. The test only needed pure helpers, but `src/isolation-runner.lib.mjs` initialized `use-m` and loaded `command-stream` at module top level, so import-time module evaluation depended on a live external CDN fetch.\n\nThat made the CI failure a false negative caused by an external network timeout rather than an isolation-runner behavior regression.\n\n## Template Comparison\n\nDownloaded and compared the JavaScript, Rust, Python, and C# AI-driven development pipeline template trees and release workflows. The JavaScript template is the closest match and uses Node 24 plus an `npm test` gate, but none of the templates contain this repository's local `isolation-runner.lib.mjs` import-time dependency. No upstream template issue was filed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node tests/test-isolation-runner.mjs`\n- `node --check src/isolation-runner.lib.mjs`\n- `node --check tests/test-isolation-runner.mjs`\n- `npm run format:check`\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm run check:duplication`\n- `bash scripts/check-file-line-limits.sh`\n- `bash scripts/check-mjs-syntax.sh`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm test` completed locally with `All 309 selected test file(s) passed.`\n- After the Helm action update: `npm run format:check` and `bash scripts/check-file-line-limits.sh`\n- GitHub Actions `Checks and release` run `29033108807` completed successfully on commit `b0e58626020146a1668ea1dfa8a1c44b6a93da77`: https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/29033108807\n\nLocal note: this workspace has Node `v20.20.2`, while package metadata and CI require Node `>=24.0.0`; the saved install log includes the expected engine warnings. GitHub Actions is the authoritative Node 24 verification.\n",
